  "review_notes": [
    "Reconciliation patch: *it* and *is* move from οὐ to τέκνα, discontinuously across the article's own *the*, which is rule 96's οὕτως καὶ τῆς παρακλήσεως → *so are ye also of the comfort* shape.",
